    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d574">

                <pb facs="0814" n="718" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg718"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Day to Mr.
                            Woodford.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-03-30T10:15:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 30,
                                1898—10.15 a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your No. 60 is encouraging, but vague as to details. The United States can not
                    assist in enforcement of any system of autonomy.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Day.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
